sequenceDiagram
    participant App as App<br>[implements GapPeripheralResponse]
    participant Node as Node<br>[implements GapPeripheral]
    participant Central as BLE Central

    Note over Node, Central: Messages between Node and BLE Central<br>are link-layer events, not driven by the App.<br>The App only observes them through<br>Echo callbacks (e.g. CurrentState).

    rect rgb(230, 230, 240)
        note over App, Central: 1. Initial bond established
        App->>Node: GapPeripheral.Advertise(type=advInd, advertisingInterval=160)
        Node-->>App: GapPeripheralResponse.CurrentState(advertising)
        Central-)Node: CONNECT_IND
        Node-->>App: GapPeripheralResponse.CurrentState(connected)
        rect rgb(245, 240, 230)
            Note over Node, Central: LESC Just Works SMP + LL encryption + key distribution
            Central-)Node: Pairing_Request
            Node-)Central: Pairing_Response
            Central-)Node: Pairing_Public_Key
            Node-)Central: Pairing_Public_Key
            Node-)Central: Pairing_Confirm
            Central-)Node: Pairing_Random
            Node-)Central: Pairing_Random
            Central-)Node: Pairing_DHKey_Check
            Node-)Central: Pairing_DHKey_Check
            Central-)Node: LL_ENC_REQ
            Node-)Central: LL_ENC_RSP
            Node-)Central: LL_START_ENC_REQ (encrypted)
            Central-)Node: LL_START_ENC_RSP (encrypted)
            Node-)Central: LL_START_ENC_RSP (encrypted)
            Node-)Central: Identity_Information (IRK)
            Node-)Central: Identity_Address_Information
            Node-)Central: Signing_Information (CSRK)
        end
        Node-->>App: GapPeripheralResponse.NumberOfBondsChanged(1)
        Node-->>App: GapPeripheralResponse.PairingResult(pairedSuccessfully=true)
    end

    rect rgb(230, 230, 240)
        note over App, Central: 2. Central disconnects and removes its bond
        rect rgb(245, 230, 230)
            Central-)Node: LL_TERMINATE_IND
        end
        Node-->>App: GapPeripheralResponse.CurrentState(standby)

        Note over App: Central has removed its bond locally.<br>Peripheral still has the bond stored.
    end

    rect rgb(230, 230, 240)
        note over App, Central: 3. Central reconnects - bond mismatch
        App->>Node: GapPeripheral.Advertise(type=advInd, advertisingInterval=160)
        Node-->>App: GapPeripheralResponse.CurrentState(advertising)
        Central-)Node: CONNECT_IND (no bond on central side)
        Node-->>App: GapPeripheralResponse.CurrentState(connected)
        rect rgb(245, 240, 230)
            Note over Node, Central: LESC Just Works SMP + LL encryption + key distribution
            Central-)Node: Pairing_Request
            Node-)Central: Pairing_Response
            Central-)Node: Pairing_Public_Key
            Node-)Central: Pairing_Public_Key
            Node-)Central: Pairing_Confirm
            Central-)Node: Pairing_Random
            Node-)Central: Pairing_Random
            Central-)Node: Pairing_DHKey_Check
            Node-)Central: Pairing_DHKey_Check
            Central-)Node: LL_ENC_REQ
            Node-)Central: LL_ENC_RSP
            Node-)Central: LL_START_ENC_REQ (encrypted)
            Central-)Node: LL_START_ENC_RSP (encrypted)
            Node-)Central: LL_START_ENC_RSP (encrypted)
            Node-)Central: Identity_Information (IRK)
            Node-)Central: Identity_Address_Information
            Node-)Central: Signing_Information (CSRK)
        end
        Note over App: Peripheral accepts and replaces the old bond.

        Node-->>App: GapPeripheralResponse.NumberOfBondsChanged(1)
        Node-->>App: GapPeripheralResponse.PairingResult(pairedSuccessfully=true)
    end
